WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:04,630
OK then

2
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,780
But Master Qi has to remind you

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,660
If the pace is too big,

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:22,190
It's easy to get involved in taking Qi Ye away, but don't think about me.

5
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:23,830
Tell others about the second reception

6
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:28,630
Especially not telling my mother

7
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:31,820
Yaqin, Manman, Xiaoyue and the others need to know

8
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,380
I'm just afraid there will be a commotion

9
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:43,500
Have you bought a boat?

10
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,460
I just took a look at it today

11
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:46,900
Haven't decided which one to buy yet

12
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:56,100
I released thirty ground dragons yesterday

13
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,380
It's almost time now. Let's go and have a look.
